ce president.</li>\n<li>Vance resigns.</li>\n<li>Trump succeeds to the presidency.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>12th amendment was before 22, so could argue that he is allowed to be VP</p>\n<p>And 22 says he cannot be elected POTUS, nothing about him being POTUS again</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 23, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC03gNhA", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 9, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8746350, "raw_content": "", "author": "Trick", "created": 1784984155981, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "FaustyArchaeus", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.patriots.win", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATC03gNhA.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.patriots.win/post/ZQDLXDMDVv13.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/1401cbp7E1YWmvFG.png", "width": 590, "content-type": "png", "height": 703}], "blurhash": "U37^_O~W$$Mxxuofj[WB?bofxvof%gRjNGa}", "full_resolution": [703, 590]}, "title": "All right then... keep your secrets", "last_comment_created": 1784984288138, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 1, "score_up": 9, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}